# Tarkbot-2
#
# Read this before adding to it: several folders of images here ARE source, not junk.
# Committed on purpose:
#   app/interact/reference_images/**   the templates the bot matches against, it cannot run without them
#   app/tests/fixtures/prices/**       the OCR ground truth corpus, filename is the answer key
#   app/gui/backgrounds/**             the GUI background photos
#   app/gui/characters/**              the GUI character art, one figure per mode tab
# Do not add a blanket *.png rule.

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Build output ----
build/
dist/
*.spec
# Written at build time from the git tag, never committed. See docs/build_and_release.md
app/__version__

# ---- Generated by the test scripts ----
# Screenshots and overlays written by tests/*.py on every run. Regenerated, never reviewed.
app/tests/output/

# ---- Node / Next.js ----
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.next/
out/
build/
.vercel/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo/
.env
.env*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.yarn/install-state.gz

# ---- Editors and OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Local tool state ----
.claude/

# ---- Not published ----
# Every top-level _-prefixed folder is local scratch and stays out: benches, soak-test debugging
# (_craft_mode_run_debugging/ and the other _*_mode_run_debugging/), scrapers, 1440p find
# patches, the screen recorder, the sudak work. Many hold real players' crash screenshots with
# their character name and rouble balance in frame, so this is also a privacy guard: do not
# un-ignore a _ folder without first checking what frames are in it.
/_*/
# Non-_ scratch the rule above does not catch:
demo_obfuscator/
# png/webp/avif size comparison scratch, ~10MB of the same picture. Globbed because this folder
# has been spelled image-size-testing and _image_size_testing both, and a rename should not
# quietly put 10MB back on the table.
*image?size?testing/
# Local cleanup/audit planning scratch, machine-local, never shipped.
cleanup_*.md
# docs/ itself stays out; readme_assets is the exception, the README links its images.
docs/*
!docs/readme_assets/
